body.translated_text:
'Mind-preceded are all <s>dharmas</s>, mind is their chief, they are mind-made;
if with a corrupt mind one speaks or acts,
then suffering follows one, as the wheel follows the foot of the ox.
Mind-preceded are all <s>dharmas</s>, mind is their chief, they are mind-made;
if with a clear mind one speaks or acts,
then happiness follows one, like a shadow that never departs.'

Those who rejoice in that and those who serve —
their share of the merit is not diminished;
they too are partakers of the merit.
